Create a capture source without a monitor for removed outputs instead of a protocol error, so a shell racing an unplug can still lock.

TODO: upstream to hyprwm/Hyprland (unfixed in main and v0.57.2 as of 2026-11-22), then drop this patch.

diff --git a/src/protocols/ImageCaptureSource.cpp b/src/protocols/ImageCaptureSource.cpp
index 0c3e0cd3..6a04118e 100644
--- a/src/protocols/ImageCaptureSource.cpp
+++ b/src/protocols/ImageCaptureSource.cpp
@@ -99,17 +99,12 @@ void COutputImageCaptureSourceProtocol::bindManager(wl_client* client, void* dat
